{"owner_words":{"at":"2026-11-20T01:35:26.729Z","words":"Spawn an MCP mastermind to read the Servex MCP toolset. I believe it's 107 tools. Do a past work search for a Servex MCP tool audit and trying to condense those into just a few tools. The whole strategy was let's have one item tool that can do anything. Now, we might need a couple extras like for Figma work or whatever, but generally, I don't know why there's 107 tools. That's all injected into the descriptions and whatever on each prompt, and it's just polluting our context. And I know for a fact I've asked at least a dozen times. Figure it out, find where I've asked for it, think through the strategy, plan a way to reduce those tools down to a smaller set, get it done, please.","caller":"voice-app"}}
{"refined":{"at":"2026-11-19T19:35:26.730-06:00","re":"2026-11-20T01:35:26.729Z","sentences":[{"n":1,"text":"Spawn an MCP mastermind to read the Servex MCP toolset."},{"n":2,"text":"I believe it's 107 tools."},{"n":3,"text":"Do a past work search for a Servex MCP tool audit and trying to condense those into just a few tools."},{"n":4,"text":"The whole strategy was let's have one item tool that can do anything."},{"n":5,"text":"Now, we might need a couple extras like for Figma work or whatever, but generally, I don't know why there's 107 tools."},{"n":6,"text":"That's all injected into the descriptions and whatever on each prompt, and it's just polluting our context."},{"n":7,"text":"And I know for a fact I've asked at least a dozen times."},{"n":8,"text":"Figure it out, find where I've asked for it, think through the strategy, plan a way to reduce those tools down to a smaller set, get it done, please."}],"sections":[],"via":"voice","by":"code","v":2}}
