{"refined":{"at":"2026-11-19T19:35:58.665-06:00","re":"2026-11-20T01:35:26.729Z","sentences":[{"n":1,"text":"Spawn an MCP mastermind to read the Servex MCP toolset."},{"n":2,"text":"I believe it's 107 tools."},{"n":3,"text":"Do a past work search for a Servex MCP tool audit and trying to condense those into just a few tools."},{"n":4,"text":"The whole strategy was let's have one item tool that can do anything."},{"n":5,"text":"Now, we might need a couple extras like for Figma work or whatever, but generally, I don't know why there's 107 tools."},{"n":6,"text":"That's all injected into the descriptions and whatever on each prompt, and it's just polluting our context."},{"n":7,"text":"And I know for a fact I've asked at least a dozen times."},{"n":8,"text":"Figure it out, find where I've asked for it, think through the strategy, plan a way to reduce those tools down to a smaller set, get it done, please."}],"sections":[{"heading":"","items":[{"id":"p1","text":"Spawn an MCP mastermind to read the Servex MCP toolset, which the owner believes is \"107 tools\"","cites":[1,2]},{"id":"p2","text":"Do a past work search for a prior Servex MCP tool audit and the effort to condense the tools into just a few tools","cites":[3,4,5,6]},{"id":"p3","text":"Figure it out: find where the owner has asked for this before, think through the strategy, plan a way to reduce the tools down to a smaller set, and get it done","cites":[8,7]}]}],"cost_usd":0.03766,"via":"voice","by":"parts","v":2}}
